<title>SINGAPORE: PCI sees 2.1 mln share cross at S$0.81.</title>
<headline>PCI sees 2.1 mln share cross at S$0.81.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 2.1 million shares in printed circuit-board maker PCI Ltd were crossed off-market at 81 Singapore cents on Wednesday morning, dealers said.</p>
<p>The action followed a similar cross on Tuesday of just over two million shares at 80 cents. Dealers could not explain the deal, which pushed PCI to the top of the actives board.</p>
<p>By 0140 GMT, PCI shares stood at 88 cents, up 2.5 cents on the day. PCI officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
